The native subject-mask bridge links against the user's installed darktable
library and derives its prompt/refinement and raster-to-vector flow in part from
darktable 5.6.1 source code, especially src/develop/masks/object.c,
src/common/ai/segmentation.*, and src/common/ras2vect.*.

