GNU General Public License version 3 or later:
https://github.com/darktable-org/darktable

photo-xmp does not bundle darktable, ONNX Runtime, or trained model files. The
user's installed darktable runtime, configuration, and models are used at run
time. Modified bridge code is part of this repository and is distributed under
GPL-3.0-or-later.
